<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Keystone rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Keystone rating cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Chicago Corp said Tuesday it downgraded Keystone Financial Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- It said the action was primarily due to current valuation, although it said an expected slowdown in earnings growth reinforced its decision.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Corp reduced its earnings estimates on Keystone by $0.07 to $1.83 for 1996, and by $0.10 to $1.97 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Keystone was trading at 24-1/4, off 1/4.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
